'''''Schoenoplectiella''''' is a genus of flowering plants in the [[Cyperaceae|sedge family]]. It has a nearly-cosmopolitan distribution.<ref name=powo/> The genus was first described in 2003 by [[Kaare Arnstein Lye]], and the type species is ''[[Schoenoplectiella articulata]]''.<ref name=apni>{{APNI2|id=244104|name=''Schoenoplectiella''}}</ref><ref name=Lye>{{cite journal|author=Lye, K.A. |date=2003| title=''Schoenoplectiella'' Lye, gen. nov. (Cyperaceae)|journal= Lidia |volume=6|pages= 20}}</ref> There are no synonyms.<ref name="powo" />

